cias.<\/p><p>Adem\u00e1s, sus cables planos y extralargos facilitan el montaje permitiendo una configuraci\u00f3n limpia y ordenada que permita un eficaz flujo de aire en el interior del equipo y una r\u00e1pida disipaci\u00f3n del calor.<\/p><br><\/div><div><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><ul>\t<li><b>Tipo:<\/b> ATX con PFC activo<\/li>\t<li><b>Potencia:<\/b> 650 W<\/li>\t<li><b>Datos t\u00e9cnicos:<\/b> +5V - 15A \/ +3.3V - 15A \/ +12V - 54A \/ -12V - 0.3A \/ +5VSB - 2.5A<\/li>\t<li><b>Voltaje:<\/b> 100 - 240 V AC | 60-50 Hz | 12.5 - 6.3 A<\/li>\t<li><b>Protecciones de seguridad:<\/b> OVP, OPP, SCP, UVP, OTP, NLP<\/li>\t<li><b>Conectores:<\/b> 1 x ATX MB 20+4 pines 1 x EPS +12V 4+4 pines 2 x PCIe 6+2 pines 4 x SATA 2 x Molex 4 pines <\/li>\t<li><b>Refrigeraci\u00f3n:<\/b> ventilador ultra silencioso de 120 mm con control de velocidad inteligente<\/li>\t<li><b>Dimensiones:<\/b> 150 x 140 x 86 mm<\/li>\t<li><b>Peso:<\/b> 1,47 kg<\/li><\/ul><\/div>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"NOX","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":1.7,"unit_price":41.5,"unit_price_tax":41.5,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Componentes","sub_category":"Fuentes de alimentacion","quantity":5,"brand":"NOX","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_nox-fuente%20urano%20p%20wh%20650%20bz_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":34.5}}},"8436587976032":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8436587976032",false],"wholesale_price":[39.79,false],"price":[46.79,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 1.7",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product w