dor:<\/b> Doble n\u00facleo a 1.3 GHz<\/li>  <li><b>Memoria:<\/b> 128 MB Flash, 256 MB RAM<\/li>  <li><b>Mejoras de velocidad:<\/b> OFDMA, beamforming est\u00e1ndar y universal, 1024-QAM, anchos de 20\/40\/80\/160 MHz<\/li>  <li><b>Frecuencias de operaci\u00f3n:<\/b> 2.4GHz \/ 5GHz<\/li>  <li><b>Modos de operaci\u00f3n:<\/b> Punto de acceso, nodo AiMesh, repetidor, router<\/li>  <li><b>Puertos:<\/b> 1 WAN Gigabit RJ45, 3 LAN Gigabit RJ45<\/li>  <li><b>Botones:<\/b> WPS, reset, encendido<\/li>  <li><b>Indicadores LED:<\/b> Alimentaci\u00f3n, WAN, LAN x3, 2.4G, 5G, WPS<\/li>  <li><b>Alimentaci\u00f3n:<\/b> Entrada 110-240V (50\/60Hz), salida 12V 1A<\/li>  <li><b>Contenido del paquete:<\/b> RT-AX52 Pro, cable RJ45, adaptador, gu\u00eda r\u00e1pida, tarjeta de garant\u00eda<\/li>  <li><b>Peso:<\/b> 298 g<\/li>  <li><b>Dimensiones:<\/b> 192 x 126,3 x 47,5 mm<\/li>  <li><b>AiMesh:<\/b> Compatible como router principal y nodo<\/li>  <li><b>Control parental:<\/b> Bloqueo de sitios y apps, programaci\u00f3n personalizada<\/li>  <li><b>Red de invitados:<\/b> Permite acceso a Internet sin acceso a red local<\/li>  <li><b>Seguridad:<\/b> WPA\/WPA2\/WPA3-Personal, WPA\/WPA2-Enterprise, WPS, SSH, cortafuegos, VPN<\/li>  <li><b>VPN:<\/b> Clie<\/li><\/ul>","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"ASUS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.7,"unit_price":67.06,"unit_price_tax":67.06,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Conectividad","sub_category":"Router WIFI","quantity":5,"brand":"ASUS","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_asu-rou%20rt-ax52%20pro_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":60.06}}},"0745604518352":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean