,"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"TP-LINK","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":24.77,"unit_price_tax":24.77,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Perif\u00e9ricos","sub_category":"Hub USB","quantity":0,"brand":"TP-LINK","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_tpl-hub%20ue330c_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":17.77}}},"8435693112099":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["8435693112099",false],"wholesale_price":[11.64,false],"price":[18.64,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.66",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:285488","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/08a36357c9826b8fee11cfdebc73fce7.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Pack Gaming Tacens ZENITH\/ Teclado Inal\u00e1mbrico + Rat\u00f3n Inal\u00e1mbrico + Alfombrilla","category":"Perif\u00e9ricos Gaming","sub_category":"Gaming - Kits Completos","unit_price":18.64,"reference":"6ZENITHES","ean13":"8435693112099","weight":"0.66","quantity":2,"brand":"TACENS","description_pt":"                                                                                                                                                ","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_tac-pack%206zenithw%20bk_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"11.64","unit_price_tax":18.64},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["8435693112099"],"reference":"6ZENITHES","name":{"1":"Pack Gaming Tacens ZENITH\/ Teclado Inal\u00e1mbrico + Rat\u00f3n Inal\u00e1mbrico + Alfombrilla","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description":{"1":"                                                                                                                                                ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"TACENS","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0.66,"unit_price":18.64,"unit_price_tax":18.64,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Perif\u00e9ricos Gaming","sub_category":"Gaming - Kits Completos","quantity":2,"brand":"TACENS","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_tac-pack%206zenithw%20bk_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":11.64}}},"4895213703154":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["4895213703154",false],"wholesale_price":[6.77,false],"price":[13.77,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0.2",false],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Product without combinations",true]},"need_alert":true,"errors":["Create product ID:285489","Cat. IDs: 2","Associated Categories","Cat. Default: 2","Deleted old images","New images created","Add: \/home\/hipermercado\/public_html\/img\/tmp\/d2221b0a9f2fb8f514d40ab7f784cbad.jpg; <br>-------------------------------"],"result":true},"feed_data":{"name_pt":"Ventilador Arctic P12 PWM PST A-RGB\/ 12cm\/ Negro","category":"Perif\u00e9ricos Gaming","sub_category":"Gaming - Ventiladores","unit_price":13.77,"reference":"ACFAN00231A","ean13":"4895213703154","weight":"0.2","quantity":5,"brand":"ARCTIC","description_pt":"<p><\/p><h2>P12 PWM PST A-RGB<\/h2><p>Ventilador PWM A-RGB de 120 mm con divisor de cable | Ventilador \u00danico<\/p><p><\/p><h2>RGB direccionable para un control total del color<\/h2><p>El P12 PWM PST A-RGB cuenta con 12 LED digitales A-RGB en la rueda central del ventilador. Estos se controlan de forma independiente y son compatibles con los est\u00e1ndares A-RGB comunes de los principales fabricantes de placas base. De esta forma, el ventilador puede iluminarse completamente directamente desde el conector A-RGB de la placa base o mediante un controlador externo, sincronizando la iluminaci\u00f3n con la de otros componentes.<\/p><h2>Modo 0 dB &#8212; Cero rpm<\/h2><p>La velocidad del ventilador se puede reducir hasta detenerse mediante PWM. Esto permite un funcionamiento silencioso en reposo y, al mismo tiempo, garantiza el m\u00e1ximo rendimiento cuando es necesario.<\/p><h2>M\u00e1xima suavidad, m\u00ednima vibraci\u00f3n<\/h2><p>El ruido de funcionamiento del nuevo motor ARCTIC es pr\u00e1cticamente imperceptible, incluso a baja velocidad. Adem\u00e1s, el P12 PWM PST A-RGB cuenta con superficies de contacto de goma, lo que minimiza las vibraciones audibles.<\/p><h2>Optimizado para alta presi\u00f3n est\u00e1tica<\/h2><p>El P12 PWM PST A-RGB funciona con un flujo de aire concentrado y alta presi\u00f3n est\u00e1tica. El ventilador garantiza una refrigeraci\u00f3n extremadamente eficiente, incluso con mayor resistencia del aire, por lo que es apto para su uso en disipadores de calor, radiadores y filtros.<\/p><h2>200 a 2000 rpm Controlado mediante PWM PST<\/h2><p>Gracias a su amplio rango de velocidad y a la innovadora tecnolog\u00eda PWM Sharing (PST), la velocidad del ventilador del P12 PWM PST A-RGB se puede controlar simult\u00e1neamente con la de los dem\u00e1s ventiladores. Esto minimiza el ruido y garantiza un rendimiento de refrigeraci\u00f3n \u00f3ptimo.<\/p><h2>Rodamiento de alta calidad<\/h2><p>Gracias a una combinaci\u00f3n de aleaci\u00f3n y lubricante desarrollada en Alemania, se reduce la fricci\u00f3n dentro del rodamiento y se logra una mayor eficiencia. De esta manera, se genera menos calor, se reduce el ruido del rodamiento y se prolonga la vida \u00fatil del ventilador.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><h2>Especificaciones<\/h2><ul><li><strong>Velocidad del ventilador<\/strong>: 200&#8212;2000 rpm controladas por PWM (0 rpm por debajo del 5 % de PWM)<\/li><li><strong>Flujo de aire<\/strong>: 48,80 cfm | 82,91 m\u00b3\/h<\/li><li><strong>Presi\u00f3n est\u00e1tica:<\/strong>&nbsp;1,85 mmH2O&#8203;<\/li><li><strong>Nivel de ruido:<\/strong>&nbsp;0,3 sonios<\/li><li><strong>Temperatura ambiente de funcionamiento:<\/strong>&nbsp;0&#8212;40 \u00b0C<\/li><li><strong>Marco del ventilador:<\/strong>&nbsp;Est\u00e1ndar<\/li><li><strong>Tipo de control:<\/strong>&nbsp;PST de modulaci\u00f3n por ancho de pulsos (PWM)<\/li><li><strong>Conector<\/strong>: Conector de 4 pines + enchufe de 4 pines<\/li><li><strong>Cojinete del ventilador<\/strong>: Cojinete fluidodin\u00e1mico<\/li><li><strong>Voltaje t\u00edpico:<\/strong>&nbsp;12 V CC<\/li><li><strong>Voltaje de arranque:<\/strong>&nbsp;5 voltios<\/li><li><strong>Corriente<\/strong>&nbsp;| Voltaje:0,11 A | 12 V CC<\/li><li><strong>Longitud del cable<\/strong>: 400 mil\u00edmetros<\/li><li><strong>LED:<\/strong>&nbsp;12 LED A-RGB<\/li><li><strong>Conector:<\/strong>&nbsp;Conector de 3 pines 5 V-DI-GND<\/li><li><strong>Corriente\/Voltaje<\/strong>:0,4 A | 5 V<\/li><li><strong>Cable<\/strong>: Cable de 400 mm con cable compartido de 80 mm, negro<\/li><li><strong>Longitud:<\/strong>&nbsp;120 mil\u00edmetros<\/li><li><strong>Ancho:<\/strong>&nbsp;120 mil\u00edmetros<\/li><li><strong>Altura&nbsp;<\/strong>:25 mil\u00edmetros<\/li><li><strong>Peso:<\/strong>&nbsp;131 gramos<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p>","images":"https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_arct-ven%20acfan00231a_1.jpg","wholesale_price":"6.77","unit_price_tax":13.77},"product_model":{"product_data":{"ean13":["4895213703154"],"reference":"ACFAN00231A","name":{"1":"Ventilador Arctic P12 PWM PST A-RGB\/ 12cm\/ Negro","